          {
            "title": "Leaving something out",
            "body": "Ingredient plus {抜|ぬ}きで: {卵|たまご}{抜|ぬ}きでお{願|ねが}いします (without egg, please). To say what you do not eat: {肉|にく}{は|wa}{食|た}べません. Useful words: {肉|にく} meat, {魚|さかな} fish, {野菜|やさい} vegetables, {卵|たまご} egg."
          }
        ]
